	(descr "Universal 4-pole PCB terminal block pad pattern for 5.0 mm AND 5.08 mm pitch parts: pads at 5.04 mm (outer pins off by at most 0.12 mm), drill 1.3 mm, oval pads 1.8 x 3.0 mm (3.24 mm gap: meets the 3 mm mains rule). Fits e.g. Phoenix Contact MKDS 1,5/4-5,08, PT 1,5/4-5,0-H, WAGO 236-104, generic 5.0 mm screw terminals. Courtyard covers the WAGO 236 (largest). +Y = wire entry side.")
